{"id":"msg_m_ex_newexotic_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_newexotic","label":"Exotic · Group"},"label":"2. Hey, I just found this cool feature.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_newexotic_01","next":null,"speakers":{"jackal":"Jackal","viper":"Viper","eh_n":"E.H."},"icons":{"jackal":"si_c111_00_s","viper":"si_c112_00_s","eh_n":"si_c113_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_01","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_01","text":"Hey, I just found this cool feature.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_02","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_02","text":"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_03","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_03","text":"You just start typing the word you want and it fills it in for you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_04","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_04","text":"It's so easy!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_05","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_05","text":"I saw the messages were from you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_06","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_06","text":"but there weren't any typos,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_07","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_07","text":"so something felt off hehe","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_08","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_08","text":"Turns out you were just using autocorrect!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_09","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_09","text":"It's super nice. All you have to do is tap the word you want.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_10","text":"Vermin seriously taste pretty good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_11","text":"???","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_12","text":"Did I read that correctly?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_13","text":"I kinda noticed you'd eat just about anything you could get your hands on,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_14","text":"but are you really eating whatever you find on the floor now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_15","text":"No, that's all wrong.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_16","text":"It wasn't what I wanted to say.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_17","text":"What were you trying to say then?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_18","text":"Not vermin.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_19","text":"Vigorously sautéed insects taste pretty good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_20","text":"?????","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_21","text":"This won't do.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_22","text":"As your squadmate I can't just sit back and watch this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_23","text":"You must be so hungry.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_24","text":"I'll find you something to eat right away.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_25","text":"Is there anything you want?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_26","text":"I mean, she said they taste good, so I don't think you have to bother hehe","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_27","text":"She likes bugs :)","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_28","text":"Sautéed ones, at that :D","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_29","text":"I'll bring you something from the Commander's Room too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_30","text":"REally??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_31","text":"Anything tasty sounds good!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_32","text":"Nooooo","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_33","text":"That was all wrong.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_34","text":"Autocrorect used all teh wrong words.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_35","text":"I wasnt' sayign vermin.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_36","text":"I was trying to say that Viper should try it too!!1","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_37","text":"Autoocrrect!111","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_38","text":"Ohhh I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_39","text":"I thought you were really eating just anything off the floor.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_40","text":"I'm glad you're not.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_41","text":"That's hilarious :')","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_42","text":"No one batted an eye because those really seem like things you'd eat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_43","text":"I mean,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_44","text":"I've known you for a long time and even I thought that's what you were trying to say.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_45","text":"Imagine what the others were thinking hehehe","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_46","text":"Jackal,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_47","text":"just to be clear...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_48","text":"If you ever get so hungry that you can't take it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_49","text":"just tell me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_50","text":"Don't eat bugs off the floor.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_51","text":"Okay!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_52","text":"I'll tell you wehn I'm hungry!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_53","text":"You tell me ifyou get hungy too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_54","text":"I can brign youf ood.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_55","text":"Sautéed insects? Hehehe","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_56","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_57","text":"Yeah, if that's what she wants.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_newexotic_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"eh_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_newexotic_02_58","text":"I'm okay.","jump":null},{"id":